WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.220
I searched the distance
I watched the sky

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:30.520
I waited for You
To pass me by

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:35.120
But in the silence
I finally knew

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.920
The breath in my lungs
Was delivered by You

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.800
Not far away
Not somewhere above

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:52.220
You have been here
You have been enough

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:59.200
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.940
You are here
You are here

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:09.100
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:18.700
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:43.500
Where hope grew quiet
Where faith grew thin

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.780
You never left me
You stayed within

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:54.000
No empty distance
No endless sea

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.440
Could ever carry
Your love from me

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:04.620
Before I called
You knew my name

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:10.540
Before I reach
Your hand remains

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:17.480
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.280
You are here
You are here

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:27.380
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:37.140
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:48.560
You are not far
You are not gone

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:54.120
You are here

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.040
In every breath
In every dawn

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:06.680
You are here
Breathe again

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:12.160
Breathe again
What was dry

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:17.380
Let it live
What was still

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:27.620
Let it rise
By Your Spirit

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:38.640
Breathe again
Breathe again

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:46.100
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:50.040
You are here
You are here

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:56.020
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:05.620
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:17.340
In You I live
In You I move

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:25.480
Every breath
Belongs to You

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:31.480
To You ...
